  "canon:title": "Toxic hepatitis induced by disulfiram in a non-alcoholic.",
  "canon:abstract": "A reversible toxic liver damage was observed in a non-alcoholic woman treated with disulfiram. The causative relationship was proven by challenge.",
  "canon:text": "Toxic hepatitis induced by disulfiram in a non-alcoholic. A reversible toxic liver damage was observed in a non-alcoholic woman treated with disulfiram. The causative relationship was proven by challenge.",
